</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER>Tarmalen Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

Updated in May 2002.

This information is based off the gnome race:
    
    Spell Max: 83%
    Skill Max: 74%

Name: The Followers of Tarmalen
Command: tarmalen
Creator: Dragoness
Your level: 30
Maximum level: 30

Description:
All followers of Tarmalen's teachings are healers. Even the youngest novice
can ease the pain of the hurt and the priests can even raise the dead. During
the War of the Gods Tarmalen and his wife Trilleon were captured and tortured
by Mordian and his undead legions. He was rescued by Faerwon who killed
Mordian and many of his most powerful undead servants. The grief of the Gods
of Light was great when they learned that Trilleon, Tarmalen's beloved, the
Goddess of Mercy, had perished under Mordian's torture. Tarmalen's grief and
anger almost drove him to madness but finally something cleared his head and
he continued to do his duty even though he is still stricken from grief. He
does not like to heal evil people. 

Joining requirements:
 Alignment must be good (passed)
 Background must be good_religious (passed)
Abilities gained when joining:
 May train skill Attack to 3%
 May train skill Bludgeons to 3%
 May train skill Burial ceremony to 18%
 May train skill Cast generic to 18%
 May train skill Cast heal to 18%
 May train skill Cast help to 18%
 May train skill Cast special to 18%
 May train skill Ceremony to 3%
 May train skill Consider to 7%
 May train skill First aid to 7%
 May train skill Mana control to 18%
 May study spell Cure light wounds to 8%
 May study spell Create food to 20%
 Receive the symbol of Tarmalen
 Receive the Blessing of Tarmalen for continuing your studies

